  "deviations": [
    "An earlier pre-fix capture was discarded after the pilot gained a tab-bar layout-settle input in its region signature. That fix is required for correctness: tab_bar sizes tabs from the retained scroll viewport, so a region reused across the first layout settles on provisional tab widths. The discarded run showed the same node-count reduction but its binaries did not contain the fix.",
    "The pilot adds extra description passes on some structure changes (sequence step 7 candidate builds p50 6 vs baseline 5). That is the measurable cost of the layout-settle guard.",
    "Quick Open filter typing is not measured because the reused hooks have no query-typing step. Steps 3-4 exercise the result-slot region only on open/close.",
    "The diagnostic sequence capture has only three pairs per arm; it is used for counters, not for the timing claim.",
    "Both arms are the same Alicorn master; this A/B isolates the Scratchpad pilot diff, not a runtime change."
  ],
